'''Clown''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made up of a orange and blue two tone split with the decal of a clown’s face imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is red, and the handle is also made up of a two tone split, but instead it is yellow and red in color with polka dots that are blue, orange, and yellow in color all over it.

==Trivia==

* It has a [[Clown (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name
* It's model and texture would soon be later used for the knife counterpart of [[Slouse's Clown (Knife)|Slouse's Clown]], a special knife given to [[Slouse]] only.
* [[Slouse]] owns more than 3,000 Clown knives, which was revealed on Twitter as of 2021.<br />

